  "releaseNotes": "# [v0.9.0-pre-be795d6d](https://github.com/Fresa/OpenAPI.WebApiGenerator/compare/a3ff9553efe49f3e9e23de6553af20591e54453e...be795d6d097c013813c8252c81b3590b4909a120) (2026-03-24)\n\n\n### Bug Fixes\n\n* **response:** content class name could be mixed pascal case where it doesn't make sense if the media type is not all lower case. NOTE: This is a breaking change if any response media types are defined as not all lower case. ([de03572](https://github.com/Fresa/OpenAPI.WebApiGenerator/commit/de03572da7cadb568e6674351f10dc63e859996f))\n* **schema:** request content schema render duplicates due to not resolving the json pointer by following  ([c78091e](https://github.com/Fresa/OpenAPI.WebApiGenerator/commit/c78091e48e0c5844a192fe222a94fe663a842808))\n\n\n### Features\n\n* **request:** generate sequential json request content ([af4da6d](https://github.com/Fresa/OpenAPI.WebApiGenerator/commit/af4da6d2adfdcb4238092d3e4875c336ec6ff050))\n* **response:** support sequential media types jsonl and json-seq ([b24dcb1](https://github.com/Fresa/OpenAPI.WebApiGenerator/commit/b24dcb1b05c6e17a51a13920678e638ac34509f6))",
